     "h": 334,
     "title": "Certified protective enclosure",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Certified protective enclosure </h3> <p>The protective enclosure enhances the safety of the automation system by providing 360° protection in accordance with current safety standards and guidelines. As an integral part of the system’s comprehensive safety concept, it meets the requirements of the international standard IEC/EN 61010-1 and is covered by the system’s cNRTLus certification, which provides assurance that the system has been independently evaluated against applicable electrical and equipment safety requirements for the U.S. and Canadian markets.</p> </figcaption>"
