  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> »coraMeasure LG« user interface </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Each automation cell is controlled through the intelligent, user-friendly »coraMeasure LG« interface, providing convenient Start, Stop, and Pause functions.</p> <p>The interface offers a clear, real-time overview of system status, operational progress, and error management. Integrated analytics tools provide valuable insights into key performance indicators, such as the number of tools processed per day and the number of rejected tools.</p> <p>Predictive maintenance capabilities further enhance system reliability and uptime. By continuously tracking and counting every movement and operating cycle, the system enables maintenance needs to be identified proactively. This allows preventive measures to be taken before component failures occur, helping minimize unplanned downtime and maximize productivity.</p>",
   "images": [
